# Raster images to WebP

## Scope

- MUST convert **any** new or updated project-owned raster the assistant adds or touches to **`.webp`** before finishing the task.
- **In scope:** `docs/`, root README assets, and other first-party screenshots.
- **Out of scope:** `tmp/`, `node_modules/`, and third-party trees unless the user points at them.

## Conversion

```bash
cwebp -q 85 path.png -o path.webp
# then update markdown refs and remove the source raster
```

- If **`cwebp`** is not installed, MUST report that and stop; MUST NOT silently keep PNG.
- MUST update every markdown path reference to the new **`.webp`** extension.
- Default removes the source raster after success (keep only when the user asks).
- MAY leave existing **`.webp`** unchanged unless the user asks to recompress.

## Verify

- README / docs preview shows the image; broken refs are fixed before claiming done.
